note-statistics-r41a the table below shows the distribution of the numbers of tokens got by a group of children in a game.

(a) find the mean of the distribution.

(b) are the median and the mode of the distribution equal? explain your answer.

(c) if n more children play the game and each of them gets 5 tokens, write down

(i) the value of n such that the mean of the distribution is increased by 1;

(ii) the least value of n such that the median of the distribution is increased by 2;

(iii) the greatest value of n such that the mode of the distribution remains unchanged. 下表顯示一組兒童在遊戲中取得的代幣數目分布。

(a) 求此分布的平均數。

(b) 此分布的中位數與眾數是否相等?解釋你的答案。

(c) 若另有 n 名兒童參與遊戲,每人取得 5 個代幣,寫出

(i) 使平均數增加 1 的 n 值;

(ii) 使中位數增加 2 的 n 最小值;

(iii) 使眾數維持不變的 n 最大值。 hkdse 2021 · p1 q11 hkdse 2021 · p1 q11 frequency balance / 頻數平衡
